  <MAP_Settings_EnablePortraitDisplayForAllSaves_Label>在所有存档中启用机械族"头像显示"</MAP_Settings_EnablePortraitDisplayForAllSaves_Label>
  <MAP_Settings_EnablePortraitDisplayForAllSaves_Description>启用后，所有存档中的玩家机械体均可通过"机械族"管理表的"头像显示"选项，将头像追加到殖民者栏。关闭时此功能仅在机械族机械师剧本中启用。</MAP_Settings_EnablePortraitDisplayForAllSaves_Description>
  <MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_Label>启用机械族机械师使用并安装脑部植入体</MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_Label>
  <MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_Description>开启后，机械族机械师可以右键选择人类脑部植入体并为自己安装。此功能会略微影响游戏启动时的加载速度。</MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_Description>
  <MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_RestartRequired>此设置将在重新启动游戏后生效。</MAP_Settings_EnableMechanoidMechanitorBrainImplants_RestartRequired>
